<title>USA: TABLE - Fed Reserve business loans rose in July 2 wk.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Fed Reserve business loans rose in July 2 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JULY 2</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............821,300 up.....2,900</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......736,600 up....15,300</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......595,200 up.....8,200</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....869,436 down...2,465</p>
<p> Financial companies.......672,169 down...2,206</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,740 up.......870</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......46,468 up.......869</p>
</text>
